-    *   The ray segment within the box is $[\mathbf{o} + t_{enter}\mathbf{d}, \mathbf{o} + t_{exit}\mathbf{d}]$.
-    *   If $t_{enter} > t_{exit}$ or the interval is invalid, the ray misses the box.
